WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.932 --> 00:00:12.175
The sailed toward Glen.

2
00:00:13.155 --> 00:00:14.816
He looked up and opened his glove.

3
00:00:15.636 --> 00:00:18.237
Glen leaned back as the ball flew over his head.

4
00:00:18.997 --> 00:00:22.518
But he fell backward, and the ball landed in the grass behind him.

5
00:00:23.198 --> 00:00:24.939
Glen jumped up and grabbed the ball.

6
00:00:26.059 --> 00:00:28.720
He threw it to the infield, but it was too late.

7
00:00:30.304 --> 00:00:31.345
Huck had scored.

8
00:00:32.665 --> 00:00:35.426
Wes Wheezer stood on the ledge of the big scoreboard.

9
00:00:36.327 --> 00:00:38.027
He added a run for Huck's team.

10
00:00:39.148 --> 00:00:41.369
Then he added an error for Glen's team.

11
00:00:42.469 --> 00:00:43.670
Glen let out a sigh.

12
00:00:43.690 --> 00:00:48.592
"I almost had that one," he said to Ivy.

13
00:00:49.652 --> 00:00:50.733
Ivy rolled her eyes.

14
00:00:50.753 --> 00:00:54.694
"Yeah, too bad almost doesn't count!"

15
00:00:57.295 --> 00:00:58.656
At last the game ended.

16
00:00:59.148 --> 00:01:00.849
Ivy and Glen's team had lost.

17
00:01:02.029 --> 00:01:04.690
The players of both teams lined up on the field.

18
00:01:05.590 --> 00:01:07.851
They walked past each other and slapped hands.

19
00:01:07.871 --> 00:01:12.132
"Good game, good game," everyone said.

20
00:01:12.973 --> 00:01:14.573
Huck and Glen slapped hands.

21
00:01:14.593 --> 00:01:16.514
"Good game—loser!"

22
00:01:16.814 --> 00:01:17.434
Huck said.

23
00:01:19.075 --> 00:01:22.456
Ivy and Glen watched as the Ucks laughed and high-fived each other.

24
00:01:24.048 --> 00:01:25.049
Ivy turned to Glen.

25
00:01:25.069 --> 00:01:27.671
"Now do you want to get back at those guys?"

26
00:01:28.192 --> 00:01:28.832
she whispered.

27
00:01:29.633 --> 00:01:30.354
Glen nodded.

28
00:01:30.374 --> 00:01:35.658
"Definitely." They looked for Ezra as they walked off the field.

29
00:01:36.899 --> 00:01:38.461
But they couldn't find him anywhere.

30
00:01:39.962 --> 00:01:41.503
Ivy spotted Willow and Clara.

31
00:01:41.523 --> 00:01:44.366
"Hey, have you guys seen Ezra?"

32
00:01:44.726 --> 00:01:45.247
she called.

33
00:01:46.327 --> 00:01:49.630
"He was walking toward the hiking trails," Willow said.

34
00:01:50.491 --> 00:01:51.232
Clara nodded.

35
00:01:52.364 --> 00:01:54.105
"He looked kind of upset."

36
00:01:54.125 --> 00:01:56.967
"Uh-oh," Ivy said.

37
00:01:56.987 --> 00:01:59.288
"Glen, we have to find him."

38
00:02:00.609 --> 00:02:02.250
Glen and Ivy went to the woods.

39
00:02:02.270 --> 00:02:06.432
"Ezra! Hey, Ezra!"

40
00:02:06.832 --> 00:02:08.974
Ivy yelled as they headed down a hiking trail.

41
00:02:08.994 --> 00:02:12.356
"Ezra, where are you?"

42
00:02:12.776 --> 00:02:13.476
Glen yelled.

43
00:02:15.017 --> 00:02:15.938
They kept walking.

44
00:02:17.338 --> 00:02:19.900
Finally they found him sitting alone on a log.

45
00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:23.261
"Whew, there you are!"

46
00:02:23.842 --> 00:02:24.402
Ivy said.

47
00:02:24.422 --> 00:02:26.483
"We were worried about you."

48
00:02:28.185 --> 00:02:28.985
Ezra looked up.

49
00:02:29.946 --> 00:02:32.127
"I just had to get away from everyone.

50
00:02:32.988 --> 00:02:35.209
At least I got to talk to my parents today.

51
00:02:36.430 --> 00:02:40.213
They promised to take me to the Museum of Technology after camp ends."

52
00:02:40.233 --> 00:02:45.857
"That's not a beach vacation at a fancy resort," Glen said.

53
00:02:45.877 --> 00:02:47.958
"But I guess it's cool."

54
00:02:47.978 --> 00:02:53.181
"Yes, it is, but what about my new nickname?"

55
00:02:54.261 --> 00:02:55.321
Ezra shook his head.

56
00:02:55.341 --> 00:03:00.122
"I'll be called Snuggy Wuggy for the rest of my life!"

57
00:03:00.142 --> 00:03:03.763
"No, you won't," Glen said.

58
00:03:03.783 --> 00:03:06.304
"It'll only be for the rest of camp."

59
00:03:07.645 --> 00:03:09.825
Ivy and Glen sat beside him on the log.

60
00:03:10.885 --> 00:03:15.147
"Listen, we're going to find a way to prank the Ucks," Ivy said.

61
00:03:15.167 --> 00:03:17.627
"We'll make them stop teasing you."

62
00:03:18.828 --> 00:03:19.948
Ezra sat up straighter.

63
00:03:20.860 --> 00:03:22.420
"Really? How?"

64
00:03:22.440 --> 00:03:27.402
"We don't know yet, but we'll think of something," Ivy said.

65
00:03:28.722 --> 00:03:31.763
She took the candy out of her pockets and passed some to the boys.

66
00:03:33.263 --> 00:03:36.084
The three sat there, thinking as they ate their candy.

67
00:03:36.104 --> 00:03:40.305
"Pranks are a big thing at camp," Glen said.

68
00:03:40.325 --> 00:03:45.947
"Last year somebody had their underwear stolen, and it was hung from the flagpole!"

69
00:03:47.567 --> 00:03:48.167
He chuckled.

70
00:03:49.228 --> 00:03:50.068
Ezra looked at him.

71
00:03:50.968 --> 00:03:52.049
"Wasn't that you?"

72
00:03:53.370 --> 00:03:55.291
Glen shrugged and didn't answer.

73
00:03:56.572 --> 00:03:58.993
A few minutes later, they heard a bugle call.

74
00:03:59.013 --> 00:04:01.895
"Time for lunch," Glen said.

75
00:04:01.915 --> 00:04:03.636
"We should get going."

76
00:04:03.656 --> 00:04:05.998
"Do we have to?"

77
00:04:06.558 --> 00:04:07.179
Ezra said.

78
00:04:08.299 --> 00:04:08.940
Ivy nodded.

79
00:04:08.960 --> 00:04:11.241
"Unfortunately, yes."

80
00:04:13.363 --> 00:04:15.124
They started back toward the lodge.

81
00:04:18.032 --> 00:04:21.815
"Ezra, maybe you could build something to scare the Ucks," Glen said.

82
00:04:21.835 --> 00:04:23.576
"Like what?"

83
00:04:23.937 --> 00:04:24.617
Ezra asked.

84
00:04:24.637 --> 00:04:28.680
"I don't know, but try to think of something," Glen said.

85
00:04:29.921 --> 00:04:32.463
Suddenly they heard a chattering sound behind them.

86
00:04:33.524 --> 00:04:35.466
They all turned to see what the noise was.

87
00:04:36.767 --> 00:04:39.389
There, beside the log, was a raccoon!

88
00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:42.591
It held a piece of candy in its paws.
